  "body": "In pre-Matrix stuff we always indexed and referred to binary content by its hashcode.  This magically factored out duplicate content in server-side content repos.  If we did this in Matrix we'd also avoid filling up diskspace with hundreds of identical cat GIFs; it's unclear why we don't?\n\n(Imported from https://matrix.org/jira/browse/SPEC-140)\n\n(Reported by @ara4n)\n",
